     Map`, defined inline per-instance since the filter's `id` needs to
     be unique) that warps its pixels along a noise field, with the
     displacement `scale` animated (plain SMIL `<animate>` on the
     filter primitive, 0 → 16 → 0 on a 2.6s loop) so the water visibly
