     and its alpha-scan entirely.

     v23 — the turbulence wobble didn't land either ("doesn't work that
     well"), and you asked for a specifically DIGITAL/glitch look
     rather than another organic-water attempt, so this dropped the SVG
     displacement filter for a VHS/signal-glitch treatment instead —
     the same visual language the palm tree's 80s swap (v10/v11,
